This is a fork of the dsh-liangshen agent preset, maintained declaratively in
/etc/nixos (modules/user/nix-maid/apps/dsh-liangshen-fork) and synced into
~/.dsh/.agent-presets/neg on rebuild/login.

Upstream provenance:
- agent.cordis.yml is adapted from the DeepSeek Harness built-in Minimal and
  Standard presets (MIT).
- tool-bootstrap.mjs comes from https://github.com/xiaobright/dsh-anchored-standard
  (MIT), with dsh-liangshen's two-stage isolation extension.
- The upstream plugin is @linxin666/dsh-liangshen (MIT/Apache-2.0 mix, see
  https://github.com/xiaobright/dsh-anchored-standard and the plugin README).

The original DeepSeek copyright and MIT license notices are in the upstream
repositories.
